      "name": "Dāvis",
      "created_at": "2026-03-23T19:19:11.570Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It looks like issue is that it’s not possible to manually add such journal entries using <code>New Journal Entry</code> form. But when going thru <code>New Share Transfer</code> form first. Submitting that and then clicking <code>Create Journal Entry</code> then it works correctly.</p>",
